@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Health check — expect 200 "Healthy"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Unknown route — expect 404 with a ProblemDetails JSON body
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Provider reachability (Deepgram, Groq) — JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health/providers

### ---------- QA Templates ----------

### List active templates (optional ?search=)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/templates?search=

### Create a template — expect 201. Copy the "id" from the response into @templateId below.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/templates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Life Insurance Sales QA",
  "description": "Full sales-call standard: greeting, discovery, product explanation, disclosures and close.",
  "criteria": [
    { "name": "Greeting & introduction", "maxPoints": 10,
      "instructions": "Agent greets the customer, gives their own name and the company name within the first minute of the call." },
    { "name": "Needs discovery", "maxPoints": 20,
      "instructions": "Before recommending a policy, the agent asks about dependants, existing cover and monthly budget." },
    { "name": "Cancellation policy explained", "maxPoints": 20,
      "instructions": "The agent clearly explains the cancellation policy, including the cooling-off period. Judge the agent's explanation — the customer mentioning cancellation does not count." }
  ]
}

### Invalid template — expect 400 with field errors (criteria[0].instructions, criteria[1].maxPoints)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/templates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Broken template",
  "criteria": [
    { "name": "Clear next steps & close", "maxPoints": 15, "instructions": "   " },
    { "name": "Objection handling", "maxPoints": 0, "instructions": "Agent answers concerns." }
  ]
}

@templateId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Get one template
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/templates/{{templateId}}

### Save edits — criteria with an "id" are updated, without one are added, missing ones are deleted;
### list order = new order. Paste real criterion ids from the GET response.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/templates/{{templateId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Life Insurance Sales QA",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "criteria": [
    { "id": "PASTE-CRITERION-ID", "name": "Greeting & introduction", "maxPoints": 10,
      "instructions": "Agent greets the customer, gives their own name and the company name." },
    { "name": "Objection handling", "maxPoints": 15,
      "instructions": "When the customer raises a concern, the agent acknowledges it and answers it directly." }
  ]
}

### Archive (never hard-deletes) — expect 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/templates/{{templateId}}

### ---------- Calls ----------
# Upload (multipart) — run from PowerShell:
#   curl.exe -F "file=@C:\path\to\test-call-01.mp3" -F "templateId=<template-id>" -F "title=Test call" -F "permissionConfirmed=true" http://localhost:5000/api/calls
# 202 Accepted; transcription and evaluation continue in the background.

@callId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Status (polled by the Processing page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/calls/{{callId}}

### Full review: transcript, AI results with evidence, calculated scores (never re-runs the AI)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/calls/{{callId}}/review

### Recording (supports Range requests, so the player can seek)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/calls/{{callId}}/audio
Range: bytes=0-1023

### Retry a failed call (only when Status = Failed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/calls/{{callId}}/retry
